              💥 *SHAITAAN* 💥

✅Allah Ta'ala ki banayi hui makhlooq mein jin bhi hai, jo humko dikhayi nahi dete magar jin humko dekh sakte hain, ye bahut taqatwar hote hain aur jahan chaahe thodi si deir mein jasakte hain, *Allah Ta'ala ne aadmiyon ko mitti se aur jin ko aag se paida kiya hai.* Ye jungalon aur pahadon mein rehte hain.

✅ *Jinon mein sab se bada jin shaitaan hai. Iska naam Iblees hai,* ye pehle aasmaan mein rehta tha, aur Allah ki bahut ibadat karta tha, Allah ne jab *Hazrat Adam(AS) yani insaanon ke sab se bade baap* ko banaya to farishton aur iblees ko kaha ke inko sajda karo sab farishton ne Allah ka hukm mana aur insaan ko sajda kiya, lekin shaitaan ne sajda na kiya. Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya ke jab maine tujh ko hukm diya to kis wajah se tu ne sajda na kiya, *shaitaan ne kaha mai is se achcha hoon mujh ko Aap ne aag se banaya hai aur ise mitti se banaya hai* . Allah ne farmaya tu jannat se utar ja tu is qabil nahi ke yahan guroor kare. Tu zaleel hai, shaitaan ne kaha ke mujhe qayamat tak ke liye mohalat dijiye Allah ne  farmaya ke ja mohalat dijati hai, Shaitaan ne phir kaha  mujhe to Aap ne mal'oon kiya hai mai bhi inko seedhe raaste se behkaonga inke aage se aur peeche se, inke dayein se aur bayein se aaonga aur in mein se aksar Aap ka shukar adaa na karenge. Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya nikalja yahan se zaleel mardood, jo log in mein se tera kehna manege in sab ko aur tujhko jahanum mein bhar doonga.

✅ *Is waqt se shaitaan hum sab ka dushman hai* aur chahta hai ke hum Allah Ta'ala ki ibadat na karein, duniya mein reh kar achche kaam na karein, Namazein na padhein, MAA BAAP ka kehna na maane, joot bolein, chori karein, kamzooron ko sataye aur pareshaan karein, kisi ki madad na karein taake Allah Ta'ala se jo baat isne kahi hai wo isko poora kar dikhaye, agar hum shaitaan ke kehne mein agaye to Allah Ta'ala ne bhi shaitaan se jo wada kiya hai isko poora karenge yani shaitaan ko aur jo iska kehna manenge sab ko jahanum mein bhar denge, *Allah hum sab ko jahanum se bachaye, Ameen.* 🤲🏻

✅Qur'an Majeed mein Allah Ta'ala ne kaha hai ke *Allah musalmaanon ka dost aur madadgaar hai unko aandheron se nikaal kar roshni ki taraf lata hai* aur jo Allah ka kehna nahi maante aur *shaitaan ke dost hai inko wo roshni se aandheron mein lejata hai.* Aise log dozakh mein hamesha rahenge.

❔Tum Allab Ta'ala ke dost banoge ya shaitaan ke?
